<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 39.1pt 0pt 21.25pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">This Notice of General Meeting and Explanatory Memorandum should be read in their entirety. If Shareholders are in doubt as to how they should vote, they should seek advice from their accountant, solicitor or other professional adviser without delay.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 39.1pt 0pt 21.25pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 39.1pt 0pt 21.25pt; text-align: justify"></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 1; Options: NewSection; Value: 1 -->
